                        Skontaktuj się<br>z naszym biurem
                    </h3>

                    <div class="w-full max-w-md mt-4 flex flex-col gap-4">
                        <a href="mailto:@contactEmail"
                           class="hidden lg:inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 w-full font-inter font-semibold text-[24px] leading-none text-[#151515] border border-[#e4e0f2] rounded-lg py-6 px-10 hover:bg-[#fafafa] transition-colors">
